  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {
        "en": "Arguing a point"
      },
      "texto": {
        "en": "A short opinion text uses the tools you already have.\n\n- a fact: **es evidente que** + indicative\n- a need: **es necesario que** + subjunctive, **hay que** + infinitive\n- a proposal: **deberíamos** + infinitive\n- a reaction: **me parece increíble que** + subjunctive\n- the main point: **lo más importante es que** + subjunctive\n\nAnd it puts them in order: **en primer lugar**, **además**, **por último**.\n\nNotice the subjunctive forms built on yo: reduzco → **reduzcamos**, hago → **haga**, protejo → **proteja**."
      }
    },
