        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write about the main environmental problems where you live and what could be done.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Say aloud what you do, and what you do not do, for the environment."
